meta {
  name: service
}

vars:pre-request {
  base_url: http://localhost:8081
  management_url: http://localhost:9081
  user_id: 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
  coach_id: 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
}

docs {
  User service SCRUM-40..46 only. Sample IDs are synthetic, not seeded accounts.
  Create an untracked .env in this collection with USER_BEARER_TOKEN from Auth.
  Every protected request resolves process.env.USER_BEARER_TOKEN. Never save tokens in tracked files.
  Run athlete requests with an ATHLETE token, admin requests with ADMIN, and coach self with applicant/COACH.
  Issuer, audience, RSA signature and local ACTIVE status are always checked; X-User-* does not authenticate.
  The examples in each request's docs are saved illustrative response fixtures, not execution evidence.
  Registration/password operations are internal gRPC only; see README.md for gRPC tooling limitations.
}
